# Copy this file to .env and fill in the value before running the app.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_-prefixed vars are inlined at build time by Expo (SDK 49+)
# from .env files automatically — no app.config changes needed.
#
# Note: unlike the usual convention, this project's .env is deliberately
# committed (not gitignored) — the URL below isn't a secret, it was already
# sitting in plaintext in source before it moved into an env var. Don't
# assume it's safe to drop a real secret into .env on that same assumption
# later; if one is ever needed, gitignore .env at that point and keep only
# this .env.example committed.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://sanccob-backend-api-btgscudjhbcdddf8.spaincentral-01.azurewebsites.net
